                                            Questions 31-36                                                                                                                                                
                                                                                                                                    </h2>
                                        <div class="ielts-reading-question-section-content">
                                            <p><em>Complete the summary using the list of phrases, A-J, below</em></p>
<p><em>Write the correct letter. <strong>A-J</strong>, in boxes</em><em style="font-size: 16px"> on your answer sheet.</em></p>
<table>
<tbody>
<tr>
<td>A. constant conflict</td>
<td>B. additional evidence</td>
<td>C. different locations</td>
</tr>
<tr>
