<p><i>Which paragraph contains the following information?</p>
<p>Write the correct letter, <b>A-F</b>, in boxes on your answer sheet.</i></p>
                                        </div>
                                        <div class="ielts-reading-questions">
                                                                                                                                                                                                <table class="ielts-reading-matching-table"><thead><tr><th></th><th>A</th><th>B</th><th>C</th><th>D</th><th>E</th><th>F</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr class="ielts-reading-question-item"><td class="ielts-reading-matching-question-cell"><strong id="ielts-reading-question-number-14" class="ielts-q-badge">14</strong> <span>reference to the rapidly increasing need for one raw material in the transport industry</span></td>
